---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import PackageCard from "../components/PackageCard.astro";
import { groupPackage, partyPackages } from "../data/pricing";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Fort Cavazos, Units, and FRG Events | Team Battle Ready"
  description="Gaming trailer for Fort Cavazos units, FRG events, homecomings, and PCS farewells. $25 off for military, first responders, and teachers. Invoice and PO on the draft terms."
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Fort Cavazos" title="Built for families who already know the word “orders.”" crumb="Military">
    <p>
      Unit days, FRG events, BOSS gatherings, homecomings, and PCS farewells use the same card as a birthday.
      Invoice and PO are welcome.
      This is not a Department of Defense program. No official insignia. A booking is not an endorsement by Fort Cavazos.
    </p>
  </PageHero>

  <section class="section prose" style="padding-top: 0.5rem">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>
        Military, first responders, and teachers get $25 off the package price, or off the weekday hourly total, with an ID or a unit email. It is a flat $25, once. Travel and add-ons stay full price.
      </p>
      <p>
        The travel fee for Fort Cavazos on this card is $0, same as Killeen, when the pin is within 30 miles. Getting the trailer on the installation is a separate step. Someone has to sponsor the vehicle or clear whatever pass the gate wants that month, and MWR may have its own vendor steps for an official event.
      </p>
      <p>
        The room is six Switch stations, about four Xbox, three PS5s, and eight tablets for younger kids.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="metal">The same party card, named for the event</h2>
      <p class="lede">Units and families book Skirmish, Mission, Campaign, or a full day. The hourly rate is not on this row.</p>
      <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3" style="margin-top: 1.25rem">
        {partyPackages.map((pkg) => <PackageCard pkg={pkg} />)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0">
    <div class="wrap grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="panel">
        <h2 class="metal" style="font-size: 1.8rem">Unit / FRG / BOSS</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 0.6rem">
          A Campaign is four hours at $549 on a weekday and $599 Friday–Sunday. A six- or eight-hour full day covers a longer family event. The $25 discount applies once. A verified unit with a purchase order can ask about the organization hourly rate. A home party cannot.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <h2 class="metal" style="font-size: 1.8rem">Homecoming</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 0.6rem">
          Most homecomings fit a Mission or a Campaign. Add a tournament pack or yard games if you want them. They are not included in the package price.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <h2 class="metal" style="font-size: 1.8rem">PCS farewell</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 0.6rem">
          Same lengths as a homecoming. PCS season in this town does not pause for a gap in the calendar. Book the date when the orders are real, not the week the truck is in the driveway.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="groups" style="padding-top: 0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Schools and other groups</p>
      <h2 class="metal">Rotations, not a promise of 100 controllers.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Killeen ISD, Cove, Belton, and Temple schools, church youth nights, and festival committees all ask the same three things: a price, a certificate of insurance, and whether you can invoice. The other two are not ready to claim. The hourly rate below is for verified organizations only.
      </p>
      <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2" style="margin-top: 1.25rem">
        <PackageCard pkg={groupPackage} />
      </div>
      <div class="panel" style="margin-top: 1rem">
        <p>
          A 6-hour full day is $749 Monday–Thursday and $799 Friday–Sunday. Eight hours is $949 / $999. Verified schools, churches, units, and nonprofits with a tax-exempt certificate or a purchase order can use $125 an hour on Monday–Thursday, three hours minimum. That rate is not for residential parties. Up to 24 players at a time, then a rotation.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top: 0.8rem">
          Quotes add 8.25% tax. Tax-exempt groups need a Texas exemption certificate.
        </p>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 0.7rem">
          Draft billing for verified units, schools, and nonprofits is net-15, purchase order welcome.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Request a quote</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
